  message: "P3 REVIEW 2026-11-01 (dev 100b6fbb6e; owner-requested re-check of open P3 items last modified before 2026-10-20; fixtures under ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/p3_review_11012026/iobcat4/). VERDICT: CURRENT. Reviewed 2026-11-01 on dev 100b6fbb6e. swift-nio-and-log.yaml:115-120 still rows Channel.addHandler under net_send. Fixture: `channel.pipeline.addHandler(h)` emits swift:external:0-0:addHandler (no hint, unclassified); a fictitious `ch.addHandler(h)` on a Channel emits swift:Channel:0-0:addHandler and io-boundaries classifies it net_send; `p.addHandler(h)` on a ChannelPipeline emits swift:ChannelPipeline:0-0:addHandler and lands in external_potential. Premise holds as filed; both questions (re-key to ChannelPipeline, setup vs net_send) are still open. MECHANISM: catalogue row keyed on an owner type (Channel) that does not declare the method, under a transfer boundary for a setup call. SHARES MECHANISM WITH: WI-mokug."  # 797b
